<title>THAILAND: SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT THAILAND 2-0.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MANCHESTER UNITED BEAT THAILAND 2-0.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manchester United beat Thailand</p>
<p>2-0 (halftime 0-0) in a soccer friendly on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Nicky Butt 66, Natee Tongsukkaew 86 own goal.</p>
